# UI theme

Only `#1E4636` `#3A2563` `#F08A3C` `#E2B451`. Full rules: `docs/BRAND.md`. Palette: `docs/brand/palette.png`.

- No black. No red. No grey. No extra hex.
- Dark field (green/violet) → gold type.
- Gold/orange field → green or violet type.
- Orange = actions and progress only.
- Theme: Greek temple / marble / etched gods (Hermes Agent *feel*, our colors).
- Same ornaments and type on every screen.
- Heavy condensed display type. Never clip or ellipsis text.
- Unveil: one step, then Continue.
